{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/it4rmdsf","slide":2,"text":"• Which number is being served?\n• How many patients are ahead?\n• Is their turn approaching?\n• Has their appointment been called?","textPreview":"• Which number is being served? | • How many patients are ahead? | • Is their turn approaching? | • Has their appointment been called?","textChars":128,"textLines":4,"bbox":[70,248,510,180]}
