{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/up47idsj","slide":2,"text":"Result: uncertainty, unnecessary waiting, and repeated questions for staff","textPreview":"Result: uncertainty, unnecessary waiting, and repeated questions for staff","textChars":74,"textLines":1,"bbox":[695,564,470,50]}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/cvyt87ql","slide":2,"name":"","geometry":"roundRect","alt":"PawEver pet owner dashboard","bbox":[670,198,520,330]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/h2u7z6","slide":2,"text":"The current queue gives pet owners a number after check-in, but the information does not update automatically. Owners need to know which number staff are serving, how many patients are ahead, whether their turn is approaching, and whether staff have called their appointment. Today they must repeatedly refresh or ask clinic staff. This creates uncertainty, unnecessary waiting, and repeated questions that interrupt clinic work."}
