{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/bxbbfq","slide":3,"text":"Our proposed solution adds a continuous real-time channel. The owner checks in and receives a queue number. When staff click Call Next Patient, the application updates the queue on the server. Socket.IO immediately broadcasts the new queue state to connected owner screens. The interface then shows the current number, patients ahead, and whether the pet has been called. The owner does not press Refresh."}
