{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/1wo89b","slide":4,"text":"WebSocket provides continuous two-way communication between a client and server. The connection stays open, so the server can send a queue change as soon as it happens. Socket.IO simplifies this work. It provides real-time events, automatic connection handling, broadcasting to multiple users, rooms that can separate clinic departments, and reconnection support. Our first proof can use one shared queue room. Department-specific rooms are part of the proposed extension."}
