{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/k6h845","slide":8,"text":"The implementation plan starts with reliable queue states, then attaches Socket.IO, defines the event contract, and updates the owner interface. The current runnable proof already demonstrates the key behavior: check-in, call-next, cancellation, automatic reconnection, and screen updates without a manual refresh. The next proposal step is to include the richer queue payload and introduce rooms for separate clinics or departments."}
