{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/i1y2mw","slide":9,"text":"For the live demonstration, I will open the pet-owner and staff pages in separate windows. The owner checks in a registered pet and receives a queue number. I leave that screen open without pressing Refresh. On the staff page, I confirm the waiting entry and click Call Next Patient. The owner screen changes automatically to show the new current number and status. I can briefly disconnect and reconnect to show Socket.IO recovery, then check in another pet and cancel it. The main proof is visible: a staff action changes every connected owner screen without manual refresh."}
