{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jc12nl","slide":10,"text":"To conclude, our proposal connects one staff action to every relevant pet-owner screen. The server updates the queue, Socket.IO broadcasts the change, and the owner interface changes without a refresh. This reduces uncertainty for owners and repeated questions for clinic staff. Thank you. I am happy to answer any questions."}